    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi <div><br></div><div>I have got a problem in using methylkit, I couldn&#39;t solve it, I just followed this normal pipeline in <a href=\"https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/3.7/bioc/vignettes/methylKit/inst/doc/methylKit.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/3.7/bioc/vignettes/methylKit/inst/doc/methylKit.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232058653000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3cinLnDrionW6N1XV_AR-i\">bioconductor</a> </div><div><br></div><div>I have put my <a href=\"https://ufile.io/lqqm6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ufile.io/lqqm6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232058654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FSVpuX-K832yLEsG8yUrd\">test_data.zip </a> (<a href=\"https://ufile.io/lqqm6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ufile.io/lqqm6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793232058654000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FSVpuX-K832yLEsG8yUrd\">https://ufile.io/lqqm6</a>)</div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><b><font size=\"1\">Cellline1:</font></b></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">l_rep1.cov </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">l_rep2.cov </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">l_rep3.cov </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><b><font size=\"1\">rline:</font></b></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">rl_rep1.cov  </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">rl_rep2.cov </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><b><font size=\"1\">serumLine:</font></b></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">srm_rep1.cov  </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">srm_rep2.cov  </font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><font size=\"1\">srm_rep3.cov</font></div></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div><br></div><div>my code :</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">meth </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unite</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">myobj</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> destrand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">FALSE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>getCorrelation</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>clusterSamples</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">meth</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;correlation&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> method</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;ward&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> plot</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>My error in clustering was :</div><div><br></div><div><div><b>The &quot;ward&quot; method has been renamed to &quot;ward.D&quot;; note new &quot;ward.D2&quot;</b></div><div><b>Error in hclust(d, HCLUST.METHODS[hclust.method]) :</b></div><div><b>  NA/NaN/Inf in foreign function call (arg 11)</b></div><div><b>In addition: Warning message:</b></div><div><b>In cor(t(x), method = METHODS[method]) : the standard deviation is zero</b></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Does anybody faced with this problem?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks</div></div>"
    ]
